ble 1（p9）区分各类推理技术。思维树等搜索方法属于自动提示改进/搜索类。',evidence_ids=['ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97'],section='reasoning')\nprint(r1,r2)"}, "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1793244598, "model": "deepseek-flash", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6", "usage": {"_type": "CompletionUsage", "completion_tokens": 391, "prompt_tokens": 8094, "total_tokens": 8485, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"_type": "PromptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4480}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8094, "output_tokens": 391, "total_tokens": 8485}}, "model_output": "{\"thought\":\"Write/update notes for pages 7-20 covering taxonomy, reasoning categories, and acting/multi-agent material seen so far.\",\"code\":\"r1=write_note(title='overview',content='论文把 agentic LLM 定义为接收自然语言输入、推理决策并自主行动以达成目标的 agent（p4）。三类能力 reasoning-acting-interacting 相互支撑；交互结果可用于数据增强形成良性循环（p4-5）。文献选择：最初用 Google Scholar 检索 “Agentic LLM”，随后用 snowballing 方法从引用中发现未收录工作；只选基于 LLM 的方法（p5 §1.2）。§1.3 介绍 LLM 训练流水线（预训练、SFT、指令微调、对齐、推理；p5-6），§1.4 指出 prompt engineering、hallucination 等对 agentic LLM 的需求（p6）。',evidence_ids=['ev-5803bf1c9a0002a5bd4f','ev-f5fa865a87a2cd077881','ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97'],section='overview')\\nr2=write_note(title='reasoning',content='§2 讲推理：(1) 多步推理，如 Chain of Thought（Wei 2022）逐步提示，零样本加 “Let’s think step by step” 也提升（p7-9）。(2) 自反思 self reflection（p10-13）。(3) 检索增强 retrieval augmentation。Table 1（p9）区分各类推理技术。思维树等搜索方法属于自动提示改进/搜索类。',evidence_ids=['ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97'],section='reasoning')\\nprint(r1,r2)\"}", "code_action": "r1=write_note(title='overview',content='论文把 agentic LLM 定义为接收自然语言输入、推理决策并自主行动以达成目标的 agent（p4）。三类能力 reasoning-acting-interacting 相互支撑；交互结果可用于数据增强形成良性循环（p4-5）。文献选择：最初用 Google Scholar 检索 “Agentic LLM”，随后用 snowballing 方法从引用中发现未收录工作；只选基于 LLM 的方法（p5 §1.2）。§1.3 介绍 LLM 训练流水线（预训练、SFT、指令微调、对齐、推理；p5-6），§1.4 指出 prompt engineering、hallucination 等对 agentic LLM 的需求（p6）。',evidence_ids=['ev-5803bf1c9a0002a5bd4f','ev-f5fa865a87a2cd077881','ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97'],section='overview')\nr2=write_note(title='reasoning',content='§2 讲推理：(1) 多步推理，如 Chain of Thought（Wei 2022）逐步提示，零样本加 “Let’s think step by step” 也提升（p7-9）。(2) 自反思 self reflection（p10-13）。(3) 检索增强 retrieval augmentation。Table 1（p9）区分各类推理技术。思维树等搜索方法属于自动提示改进/搜索类。',evidence_ids=['ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97'],section='reasoning')\nprint(r1,r2)", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'overview', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 317} {'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 196}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8094, "output_tokens": 391, "total_tokens": 8485}, "is_final_answer": false}}
