{"event": "tool_result", "time": 1793244610.0850446, "run_id": "e062ae75f4864af1bc6c029afbd89bab", "seq": 201, "action": {"tool": "write_note", "title": "reasoning", "content": "补记 p16-18：Tree of Thoughts 的外部控制算法也可内化为模型训练（Schultz 2024 训练 LLM 做树搜索；Giannou 2023 用 RASP 把循环 transformer 映射为计算器/线性代数库）。隐式推理（Self Taught Reasoner 用推理生成数据增强 SFT）与 DeepSeek-R1 的 RL（GRPO 组内打分、无需独立 critic；RLVR 可验证奖励）让反思与探索行为自发涌现。Self Consistency 之外，Self Reflection 易因多角色提示交互而难调试，长轨迹会超出上下文（p18）。System 1/System 2 框架见 p18。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248", "ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c", "ev-6297cb688893b79c33c4"], "section": "reasoning"}, "result": {"note_id": "reasoning", "sources": ["paper.pdf"], "chars": 315}}
