 8947}}, "model_output": "{\"thought\":\"Note p19-22 content: limitations (causal/common-sense reasoning), AGI/interpretability sections, benchmarks use case, then Section 3 Acting: world models, robotics (SayCan, Inner Monologue, Chain of Tools). Update reasoning/overview notes and request next batch.\",\"code\":\"n=write_note(title='overview',content='补记 p19-22：§2.4.3 推理局限—LLM 缺因果推断/反事实能力、组合谜题（如汉诺塔）表现差；对抗性注入无关事实可使推理模型过度思考并升高错误率。§2.4.4 AGI 传统视智能为个体竞争性推理问题，但人类智能在社交情境中涌现。§2.4.5 可解释性：LIME/SHAP/反事实、机制可解释性（稀疏自编码器、神经透镜、电路发现）。§2.4.6 用例为决策、数学应用题、算法生成、问答基准；检索增强最接近真实 agent 行为。§3 Acting：世界模型（WorldCoder）支持规划；SayCan、Inner Monologue 用语言反馈驱动机器人操作；Chain of Tools 采用计划-执行-观察流水线。',evidence_ids=['ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23','ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc','ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b'],section='overview')\\nprint(n)\\np=read_pdf(start_page=23,end_page=26)\\nprint(len(p.get('pages',[])) if isinstance(p,dict) else p)\"}", "code_action": "n=write_note(title='overview',content='补记 p19-22：§2.4.3 推理局限—LLM 缺因果推断/反事实能力、组合谜题（如汉诺塔）表现差；对抗性注入无关事实可使推理模型过度思考并升高错误率。§2.4.4 AGI 传统视智能为个体竞争性推理问题，但人类智能在社交情境中涌现。§2.4.5 可解释性：LIME/SHAP/反事实、机制可解释性（稀疏自编码器、神经透镜、电路发现）。§2.4.6 用例为决策、数学应用题、算法生成、问答基准；检索增强最接近真实 agent 行为。§3 Acting：世界模型（WorldCoder）支持规划；SayCan、Inner Monologue 用语言反馈驱动机器人操作；Chain of Tools 采用计划-执行-观察流水线。',evidence_ids=['ev-562f05b08e87ac882b23','ev-f5fab558c5f762a67dcc','ev-7f4d5e2fe0886c80c09b'],section='overview')\nprint(n)\np=read_pdf(start_page=23,end_page=26)\nprint(len(p.get('pages',[])) if isinstance(p,dict) else p)", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'overview', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 314}\n4\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8584, "output_tokens": 363, "total_tokens": 8947}, "is_final_answer": false}}
